Kitty Bot — Privacy Policy

Last Updated: September 23, 2026

This Privacy Policy explains how Kitty Bot (“Kitty,” “the Bot,” “we,” “us,” or “our”) may collect, use, store, and protect information when you use Kitty Bot on Discord.

1. Information We May Collect

Depending on the features you use, Kitty Bot may process information such as:

Discord Information

- Discord user ID
- Discord server ID
- Discord channel ID
- Discord role ID
- Discord username or display name where required for a feature
- Server configuration and Bot settings

Command and Interaction Data

We may process information associated with commands or interactions with Kitty Bot when necessary to provide, maintain, secure, or troubleshoot the service.

Optional Feature Data

Some Kitty Bot features may require additional information to function, such as economy balances, profiles, preferences, cooldowns, statistics, or other user-created data.

We only intend to collect information reasonably necessary for the relevant feature.

2. How We Use Information

Information may be used to:

- Provide Kitty Bot's features.
- Store server and user settings.
- Maintain economy, profile, or other feature-related data.
- Respond to commands and interactions.
- Prevent abuse and unauthorized activity.
- Troubleshoot technical problems.
- Improve reliability and functionality.
- Comply with applicable legal obligations.

We do not use information for purposes unrelated to the operation of Kitty Bot unless permitted by applicable law or otherwise disclosed to you.

3. Information Sharing

We do not sell personal information.

Information may be shared with service providers or infrastructure providers when reasonably necessary to operate Kitty Bot, such as hosting, databases, logging, or security services.

We may also disclose information when required by law or when reasonably necessary to protect the security, rights, or property of Kitty Bot, its users, or others.

4. Discord

Kitty Bot receives information through Discord's platform and APIs as necessary for the Bot to function.

Your use of Discord is also governed by Discord's own privacy practices and policies.

Kitty Bot does not control information collected directly by Discord.

5. Data Retention

We retain information only for as long as reasonably necessary for the purposes described in this Privacy Policy, unless a longer retention period is required or permitted by law.

Certain data may be deleted when it is no longer necessary for the relevant feature.

6. Data Deletion

Where applicable, you may request deletion of data associated with your use of Kitty Bot.

Deletion requests may be subject to reasonable verification and legal or operational requirements.

To request deletion, contact the Kitty Bot development team through the official support server or contact method provided by Kitty Bot.

7. Security

We take reasonable measures intended to protect information from unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction.

However, no online service can guarantee absolute security.

8. Children's Privacy

Kitty Bot is not intended to knowingly collect personal information from children in violation of applicable laws.

If you believe that we have collected information that should not have been collected, contact the Kitty Bot development team so the matter can be reviewed.

9. Your Rights

Depending on your location and applicable law, you may have rights regarding your personal information, including rights to request access, correction, or deletion.

Requests can be made through the official Kitty Bot support/contact method.

10. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy when our practices or applicable requirements change.

The “Last Updated” date will be changed when the policy is revised.

11. Contact

For privacy questions, data requests, or concerns, contact the Kitty Bot development team through the official support server or contact method provided by Kitty Bot.

